title: "dots-cli-es"
abstract: >
  Elasticsearch indexing CLI and search API for TEI resources published through a
  DoTS (Distributed Text Services) endpoint. dots-cli-es crawls a DTS collection
  tree with ThunderDots, builds Elasticsearch documents for collections, resources
  and TEI fragments from a declarative registry of search fields, reports on every
  indexing run, and exposes a faceted full-text search API consumed by the dots-vue
  front-end.
